"hero": "\n<section\n        class=\"page-hero service-hero\"\n        style=\"--service-image: url(&quot;hot-water-drainage-perth.png&quot;)\"\n      >\n        <div class=\"shell\">\n          {{ppp:breadcrumbs}}\n          <span class=\"eyebrow\">Plumbing repair service</span>\n          <h1>Hot Water Repairs &amp; System Replacement Perth</h1>\n<p>No hot water, an unreliable shower temperature or a leaking hot-water unit? Ellis Services Group provides hot-water repairs and replacement assessments across Perth. Our local plumbing and electrical team investigates the fault, explains the practical repair options and provides a written quote before the agreed work proceeds.</p>\n          <a class=\"button\" href=\"tel:0413477667\">Call 0413 477 667</a> <a class=\"button service-book-button\" href=\"contact.html?service=hot-water-problems-perth.html\">Book hot-water repair</a>\n        </div>\n      </section>" as TrustedHtml,
